    .addHelpText(
      'after',
      `
Examples:
  $ codereach                            start remote control for this project
  $ codereach --name "api refactor"      label this session in the app
  $ codereach -m opencode/glm-5.3-flash-free
                                           run phone-created sessions on a free model
  $ codereach --relay http://localhost:8788
                                           use a relay running locally
  $ codereach --attach http://127.0.0.1:4596
